  ($g983$rep_ex17_20$g983$, $g984$gap$g984$, $g985$advanced$g985$, $g986${"id":"rep_ex17_20","level":"advanced","group":17,"gord":17,"no":20,"instruction":"Turn the sentences into reported speech using an appropriate introductory verb.","prompt":"'That's the most beautiful necklace I've ever seen!' Amanda said. → Amanda ______.","answers":["exclaimed it was the most beautiful necklace she had ever seen","exclaimed that it was the most beautiful necklace she had ever seen","exclaimed it was the most beautiful necklace she'd ever seen","exclaimed that it was the most beautiful necklace she'd ever seen","remarked it was the most beautiful necklace she had ever seen","remarked that it was the most beautiful necklace she had ever seen","remarked it was the most beautiful necklace she'd ever seen","remarked that it was the most beautiful necklace she'd ever seen","said it was the most beautiful necklace she had ever seen","said that it was the most beautiful necklace she had ever seen","said it was the most beautiful necklace she'd ever seen","said that it was the most beautiful necklace she'd ever seen"],"explanation":"Exclaim / remark + that-клауза; present perfect → past perfect."}$g986$, 166, $g987$rep_verbs$g987$)
